You establish a powerful mental link with your Worm that Walks.

As long as you remain within radius 3 of your worm that walks each of you gains [15%, 18%, 20%, 23%, 25% (TL1-5)] all resistance for 5 turns.

Additionally, your Worm that Walks permanently gains an inscription slot every 2 raw talent levels ([0, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)]).
